--- body ---
## Context

Once design is locked (ticket 0175), run the full sweep:
17 models × 5 repeats = 85 runs, temperature=0, seed=42, max_tokens=32768,
base.txt prompt, locked system_instruction (parametric, no web).
Journal model set: 3 Anthropic + 3 OpenAI + 3 Mistral + 6 Qwen + 2 DeepSeek.

## Actions

1. Confirm preflight passes: `make -C experiments preflight`
2. Smoke: one model × repeat=1 (mistral-small-2603) to verify finish_reason=stop,
   max_tokens/seed/system_instruction propagated, parse OK.
3. Generate jobs: `uv run python -m aedist.manager generate --sweep
   sweep_ablation_p1_direct_base --experiments experiments.toml`
   — assert exactly 85 jobs queued (17 × 5).
4. Drain with OR_MAX=8 parallel openrouter workers.
5. Monitor for refusals, parse errors, truncation. Specifically watch Opus 4.6
   — any finish_reason=length is a regression (escalate).
6. Run `make -C experiments rebuild-measurements` to ingest results.
7. Spot-check 3 runs manually: one high-F1, one low (non-null) F1, one
   refusal/parse-error if any.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] 85 run files in `experiments/outputs/ablation/direct/p1_base/`
- [ ] All 85 runs in `measurements.jsonl` with `prompt_version = "p1_base"`
      and `max_tokens=32768` recorded per row
- [ ] Refusal/parse-error/length-truncation counts logged here
- [ ] Spot-check passed (3 runs reviewed)
- [ ] Per-model cost table in PR body
- [ ] Total spend ≤ $15 (budget cap)
